69,"_83":170,"_85":170,"_86":171,"_88":89,"_90":172,"_92":173},{"_81":164,"_83":165,"_85":165,"_86":166,"_88":89,"_90":167,"_92":168},{"_81":159,"_83":160,"_85":160,"_86":161,"_88":89,"_90":162,"_92":163},{"_81":154,"_83":155,"_85":155,"_86":156,"_88":89,"_90":157,"_92":158},{"_81":149,"_83":150,"_85":150,"_86":151,"_88":89,"_90":152,"_92":153},{"_81":144,"_83":145,"_85":145,"_86":146,"_88":89,"_90":147,"_92":148},{"_81":139,"_83":140,"_85":140,"_86":141,"_88":89,"_90":142,"_92":143},{"_81":134,"_83":135,"_85":135,"_86":136,"_88":89,"_90":137,"_92":138},{"_81":129,"_83":130,"_85":130,"_86":131,"_88":89,"_90":132,"_92":133},{"_81":124,"_83":125,"_85":125,"_86":126,"_88":89,"_90":127,"_92":128},{"_81":119,"_83":120,"_85":120,"_86":121,"_88":89,"_90":122,"_92":123},{"_81":114,"_83":115,"_85":115,"_86":116,"_88":89,"_90":117,"_92":118},{"_81":109,"_83":110,"_85":110,"_86":111,"_88":89,"_90":112,"_92":113},{"_81":104,"_83":105,"_85":105,"_86":106,"_88":89,"_90":107,"_92":108},{"_81":99,"_83":100,"_85":100,"_86":101,"_88":89,"_90":102,"_92":103},{"_81":94,"_83":95,"_85":95,"_86":96,"_88":89,"_90":97,"_92":98},{"_81":82,"_83":84,"_85":84,"_86":87,"_88":89,"_90":91,"_92":93},"slug","skills/level-design/templates/review","title","Level Review Template","label","description","Review a level's goals, spatial flow, readability, encounters, technical limits and next revisions using a reusable checklist.","group","More notes","source","docs/skills/level-design/templates/review.md","sourceHash","779a2edb6080480f4b73ad9b96692b9ae7eb4aa3e2f1bd613c637b4240ee608b","skills/level-design/templates/playtest-report","Playtest Report Template","Record a playtest's task, observed behavior, participant comments, blockers and follow-up checks without mixing evidence and interpretation.","docs/skills/level-design/templates/playtest-report.md","1fefc9190edd9a460a263033c12f79b555e4fb7ef3e139bfb75d7ca5061ff8a2","skills/level-design/templates/level-brief","Level Brief Template","Fill in a level brief with player intent, scope, routes, encounter goals, constraints and observable acceptance criteria.","docs/skills/level-design/templates/level-brief.md","21ca07d5e829cc7bb4bd2719ae24d9d8bfe2e71e1c607526e0907aacabad9927","skills/level-design/references/wayfinding-playtesting","Wayfinding, Player Understanding, and Playtesting","Test how players understand a space using observed routes, wayfinding cues and playtest evidence rather than designer assumptions.","docs/skills/level-design/references/wayfinding-playtesting.md","778c6d2ab5095aa2a794c5b84da4cdef575350af9b235ca983c5e1a2a0307c6e","skills/level-design/references/tools-quake","Tools, Resources, TrenchBroom, Quake, and File Formats","Review TrenchBroom, Quake workflows and level file formats with the tool and engine boundaries each requires.","docs/skills/level-design/references/tools-quake.md","62d3e4393042b8338c0655724e19b9f2e3f654c6e314e05516dd2e9c2cc46392","skills/level-design/references/spatial-layout","Layout, Flow, Verticality, Critical Paths, and Gates","Shape critical paths, alternate routes, gates, verticality and flow around the choices a player should make.","docs/skills/level-design/references/spatial-layout.md","e8641eb15099627cf59978304ef807c5ade18f886bd02e8519739c2405249e6a","skills/level-design/references/source-map","Source Map and Reading Coverage","Trace the level-design skill's topics and adaptations to the original Level Design Book reading coverage.","docs/skills/level-design/references/source-map.md","0e0bf748565ed9da345e0f2a01261a6cc5ea8af80933a21389b3f79ef9742ca0","skills/level-design/references/scripting-doors","Scripting, Navigation, and Doors","Specify scripted interactions, navigation dependencies and door states with readable feedback and recoverable behavior.","docs/skills/level-design/references/scripting-doors.md","31194f2df5c662e41fa292b6ee820bbc594a22ec421cdea1f6cba207b5a2a2eb","skills/level-design/references/optimization-release","Optimization, Documentation, Packaging, and Release","Prepare a level for release through performance work, documentation, packaging and checks on the target build.","docs/skills/level-design/references/optimization-release.md","c861e21126e62c18971e1f0ced575cf4f6605fdf9e3310d753ccd85b377fc9ca","skills/level-design/references/lighting-art","Lighting, Darkness, Environment Art, Texturing, and Storytelling","Use lighting, darkness, materials and environmental storytelling to support navigation, readability and the intended experience.","docs/skills/level-design/references/lighting-art.md","ce11613f8c7efe1ab46a656e34fbfe837dea9e2cda21eb8b65c5dd7ab29e1d90","skills/level-design/references/learning","Learning, Teaching, Exercises, Critique, and Portfolios","Use exercises, critique, teaching methods and portfolio evidence to develop and explain level-design decisions.","docs/skills/level-design/references/learning.md","dfcd003181de23901a8944c7af364311108a4c66f1a7daf1d2c2409ccd0382b0","skills/level-design/references/foundations","Foundations, Pre-production, Research, Worldbuilding, and Scope","Set player intent, research questions, worldbuilding constraints and project scope before drawing a level layout.","docs/skills/level-design/references/foundations.md","79cc3bd4a123904fad9309d7444fd27d62287fe1307e1529a60104f493ce8b5a","skills/level-design/references/culture-history","Level Design as Culture and Historical Practice","Place level-design practices in their cultural and historical context instead of treating familiar conventions as universal rules.","docs/skills/level-design/references/culture-history.md","fec0df471ced497b20c5e0ccd08340f3ac3297393ac618cff7626256333f4d0a","skills/level-design/references/combat-balance","Combat, Enemy Roles, Encounters, Cover, and Map Balance","Design encounters around enemy roles, sightlines, cover, movement and multiplayer balance, then test the resulting decisions.","docs/skills/level-design/references/combat-balance.md","bdbe6945e7cd9a51aa50ad9a1b02fac12635f9ec8f0f187c1753abba871033c8","skills/level-design/references/case-studies","Studying Levels and Transferring Their Relationships","Study existing levels by reconstructing spatial and gameplay relationships, then adapt those relationships to a new brief.","docs/skills/level-design/references/case-studies.md","4f0643c5d776144531ec46b2af1936158eea6780aa84751d74b0ca61237a52b0","skills/level-design/references/blockout-metrics","Blockout, Massing, Landscape, Composition, and Metrics","Plan graybox massing, terrain, composition and player-scale metrics before committing to finished environment art.","docs/skills/level-design/references/blockout-metrics.md","aba747e2d92c367001c3f3c6b5b4027472926beac9dff33882025c6a631c1898","editorial-art-prompts","GameMap editorial art prompts","Inspect the prompts and provenance for GameMap's AI-generated editorial artwork, separate from authentic project previews.","docs/editorial-art-prompts.md","b3f0de7a3550006db1ebb6d92cddbbe9cd96554e721dbe3639812e3129eef7ad","design/v2/design-system","Historical design archive · World Studio concept","Historical archive of the World Studio concept, preserving an earlier design iteration and its superseded build assumptions.","docs/design/v2/design-system.md","91b5cf7d8f914b28b7ba3cd61f1875805c31fedb17c69c6005acc8770e329585","design/design-system","Historical design archive · first concept","Historical archive of GameMap's first visual concept; its palette, fonts and layout are superseded rather than current requirements.","docs/design/design-system.md","797579aba5db01ce949e27ed08c4f547cb3bef4a8a9b8f23186eb76a2e385ce4","zh/publishing-platforms","发现游戏，发布自己的作品","发行与游戏平台","从官方入口了解 Steam、itch.io 等游戏平台，分清试玩、下载、源码与发行状态。","中文指南","docs/zh/publishing-platforms.md","bbfd4f281d7377ff703903e7a1503a5a420965545e029bb85d35b81af95bd977","zh/deployment","在本地运行和发布 GameMap","本地运行与部署","预览完整静态网站，检查页面、导航与搜索，并通过 GitHub Pages 发布。","docs/zh/deployment.md","a4d586b6726d96075377a0886997a9a5a5ad37f678750823de4ec2ee7458f4fa","zh/level-design-skill","关卡设计 Skill","了解关卡设计 Skill 的适用范围、下载入口、简报与试玩模板，以及来源和非商业许可条件。","docs/zh/level-design-skill.md","fcf46c19f6167fb34c8fa4a2026f10b72566ce61dcf6e02abf616f719b2ccb7c","zh/practical-guide","从想法到可玩的游戏","用一个无需安装依赖的 HTML 小游戏跑通开始、游玩、胜负与重试，再完成一次边界明确的修改。","docs/zh/practical-guide.md","f1d7c3b06c422562e82bb2998ea580d1a084529325f1d7e719cc0f98b015c1ae","zh/reading-guide","怎样使用这份资料库","怎样使用资料库","按当前问题选择工具、案例或研究资料，分清来源、可运行性、许可与实际验证范围。","docs/zh/reading-guide.md","2177ae41d02ce8ed282e0dea85820cbf86a6cc0a8d19be9656fe105d98564a6b","skills/level-design/LICENSE","Attribution, License, and Adaptation Notice","Skill attribution & license","Read attribution and CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 reuse conditions for the unofficial Level Design Book skill adaptation.","Skills & practice","docs/skills/level-design/LICENSE.md","7baf28f0942b105ddcf68f80f73dfbdba24d7207f60e6876ddb99d28d417e3a6","skills/level-design/SKILL","Level Design: From Intended Experience to Tested Space","Level design skill","Route a level-design task from player intent and research through layout, grayboxing, playtesting and revision.","docs/skills/level-design/SKILL.md","81c8dd3c0237982e39772cd3d778e4d258d0c1a7ace0fe74daf7cd6994702f27","level-design-skill","Level design guide","Use a source-attributed level-design skill package with topical references, brief and playtest templates, and clear license terms.","docs/level-design-skill.md","71ec8a18dee374979b028bd2d5e678e97bb15b9fea73b8c6c0d66ce42aae9347","content-model","Content model and coverage contract","Content model & coverage","Understand registered content kinds, source ownership, localization, generated outputs and completeness checks.","About this atlas","docs/content-model.md","c9840507e5663eb52fd682b4464418a0575d0af7e5a8ab1649fbf4b6b5c71d97","deployment","Website development and deployment","Development & deployment","Run the ready-to-host static GameMap snapshot locally, verify its paths, and publish the complete folder with GitHub Pages.","docs/deployment.md","f76889fc7fd2a238ec85ae39bd4d0f8ddefade5920cff3b28edcc8ab70a2ce9b","icon-sources","GameMap resource logo sources","Logo sources","Find the official sources, local files and attribution records for resource logos and visual identity assets.","docs/icon-sources.md","0ea590342f9a347f741eff7b9466a384b125d16a10dd9227f0dbd4504a061a55","media-sources","GameMap demo media sources","Media sources","Trace project previews and recordings to their original creators, capture methods, credits and reuse limitations.","docs/media-sources.md","7ba2ca5e805668e568cb7cfe9948bc57f599d3f51b890f1768f2915f913d70bc","contributing","Contributing to GameMap","Contributing","Contribute resources and game cases with primary evidence, accurate source scope, runnable access and clear attribution.","CONTRIBUTING.md","9ab50fd9dbbc7f32cac694a9903e9371436cb2e97e90a84110e1c5b65abdc53f","catalog","Awesome AI Game Development","Full resource catalog","Browse the complete resource catalog with categories, source links and scope notes for AI-assisted game development.","AWESOME.md","b0d58b0f5a8da338f4e7e186f4df92b6ecc376a4793bed5d98802e98ba9c77a8","overview","GameMap","Project overview","Explore GameMap, an OpenEnvision project connecting AI game-development tools, playable projects and practical production knowledge.","README.md","4f238c9d10e302cfb7ee0f5cc5df468bfac22018399653df5fa12f9d153e63d4","community-case-research","Community AI game case review","Community case research","Inspect the research log behind community game cases, including source completeness, AI attribution, play checks and rejected candidates.","Evidence & evaluation","docs/community-case-research.md","80f6157a66cec65c54a816e96c6f737e956faa58b9415e590365f59621ef8024","source-revision-notes","Source revision and implementation boundaries","Source revisions","Trace research claims to reviewed source revisions and distinguish stable release evidence from moving documentation.","docs/source-revision-notes.md","d074761cd7ff667d22331b02a2e9ca843831c4525a411757700e5c9d8cedf896","catalog-review-coverage","Catalog review coverage","Review coverage","Read the catalog's source-review ledger, including verification scope, rejected claims and remaining coverage gaps.","docs/catalog-review-coverage.md","b0021a07ffa9c64b4d90fd53d2353d52e7904f52eb71408e76c995b673a4f001","agent-interface-evidence","Coding-agent game interfaces: source evidence","Agent interfaces","Review engine-agent interfaces for permissions, observations, reset behavior and evidence of the operations they actually expose.","docs/agent-interface-evidence.md","7510f6ff8fdce7d3ba4b1ea35befc17cfc7796b9f826d4157b166817a300b582","gameplay-state-contracts","Gameplay state, narrative checkpoints and durable effects","Gameplay state","Specify durable gameplay state across saves, retries, narrative transitions, cancellation and restored world effects.","docs/gameplay-state-contracts.md","39daa242fce97cd61aa619a90f35ec12f314b9adf8a59936546967fa46bca50e","benchmark-reproducibility","Reproducing game-development benchmarks","Benchmark reproducibility","Audit game-agent benchmarks by environments, actions, resets, seeds, versions and the evidence needed to reproduce a result.","docs/benchmark-reproducibility.md","4ff4a210639b7e3f49a024faa488424bbf45bae2d95517fdf3b9ad0d4bdf0133","game-development-evaluation","Additional evaluation research for agents that create games","Development evaluation","Choose evaluation tasks and metrics that distinguish code completion, game behavior, visual quality and player experience.","docs/game-development-evaluation.md","e294011f80cbdce3f3931c408edbc1d7de355ba27dfb811e6741d3bae317d9df","visual-feedback-mechanisms","Visual-feedback mechanisms for game-creation harnesses","Visual feedback","Design a visual feedback loop that joins observations, task context, proposed edits and checks without treating an image as proof of success.","Assets & generative tools","docs/visual-feedback-mechanisms.md","9800f24df8b5f7e859c46ed058400152ed23f501ba83e3e4a2362eede6d6aac8","visual-evidence-research","Visual evidence and agent-harness research","Visual evidence","Choose screenshot, segmentation, video and frame-readback evidence with explicit capture identity and observation limits.","docs/visual-evidence-research.md","160171b2f4332bba01be76fa6b5d3bcd64e56367e0a55ca9835fd9ada6f26aa8","asset-selection-feedback","Asset candidate selection and visual-feedback creation","Asset selection","Turn asset search and review into a bounded selection process with candidate identity, reasons, feedback and acceptance checks.","docs/asset-selection-feedback.md","04f504b0bf14a4df47005642258b4e7510addb575c690ab855f678710fa0d06e","asset-validation-contracts","Asset interchange and validation contracts","Asset validation","Validate sprites, tilemaps, meshes, rigs, collision, materials and audio against the runtime behavior each asset must support.","docs/asset-validation-contracts.md","5a2c80a8b3ca37f1fb0a26de94023a602355b13e32e2b4d613ba9f69d934abd8","generation-delivery-contracts","Generation jobs, artifact delivery and asset acquisition","Generation & delivery","Track generated jobs and artifacts through retrieval, cancellation, provenance and delivery to an engine or content pipeline.","docs/generation-delivery-contracts.md","81be65c35e61babf8933d2cba4163c292a1a6b6eeeb94e9bb36af38e799fb619","generative-api-boundaries","Generative API and model boundaries","API boundaries","Check authentication, job lifecycle, quotas, output access and usage conditions before integrating a generative service.","docs/generative-api-boundaries.md","64f71410f530db6da3bca0aaa3f9c99a706540272af989db252075102e582817","generative-tools-research","Generative tools: additional source-reviewed research","Generative tools","Review generation tools by the assets they produce, their documented interfaces and the work still required for game integration.","docs/generative-tools-research.md","4780eb1f63fa2300d03d3f4c3c4858f6a07639b0e66e7a78f1e30d47bbcdd611","production-coverage-gaps","Production coverage and remaining work","Coverage & limitations","See which production interfaces and evidence contracts are documented and which executable integrations remain unfinished.","Production & engineering","docs/production-coverage-gaps.md","3cb5daf6bf9e4dd28c0f26a79f08e6c9f1f3d4f3bc897401dd03ee207f99cf3f","production-debugging-contracts","Production debugging and evidence contracts","Debugging contracts","Match profiler, GPU, physics, memory and build evidence to a specific failure and a repeatable diagnostic task.","docs/production-debugging-contracts.md","a54714123e7a1ca1937f0ca687565d4a069d52d4014bab162f862517c8ea28f3","native-operation-details","Native operation details and lifecycle boundaries","Native operations","Look up native commands and lifecycle boundaries for import, rendering, input, audio, dialogue and browser captions.","docs/native-operation-details.md","f6b2d944a9c4cfa8ea937d120aee0e1d50b6b85a9981964185268febecb68d13","studio-production-case-studies","Studio production case studies and acceptance lessons","Studio case studies","Translate documented game-studio engineering accounts into proposed workflows while preserving each source's scope and limits.","docs/studio-production-case-studies.md","56eeef744a25f7a377eb797ebb4f669685f2b3b356e3e29342085902346459b7","production-work-orders","Production work orders: artifacts, recovery and acceptance","Production work orders","Adapt bounded production task templates for asset integration, navigation, multiplayer, builds and other engine workflows.","docs/production-work-orders.md","c612e8d796834f907606b68a7d90d3f75eabdf5ef5f14b0f2842dbe2a53985e2","engine-operation-contracts","Engine operations: completion, recovery, and evidence","Engine operations","Define engine operations with explicit inputs, completion, failure, cancellation and persisted output instead of relying on tool success messages.","docs/engine-operation-contracts.md","36f9e2afea2659af26299d81f3165bb22a8dcc940622cfb78b27bee6458fc0a2","production-research-notes","Production tools and acceptance boundaries","Production research","Connect production-stage tools and interfaces to concrete artifacts, completion signals and the gaps that still need testing.","docs/production-research-notes.md","b713a8ed1f662d7f79708cd4363cd3580c0a980757e15638aa1467c0506b25b2","research-index","Production research dossiers","Research overview","Navigate production research by task, from engine operations and asset delivery to state, debugging and evaluation evidence.","docs/research-index.md","e1d872b4e5982d699ceda5e95eb031b2650b40447eec59540d938f1a6e2a9872","world-model-notes","Coding World Models: Categories, Selection, and Research Notes","World models","Distinguish executable code worlds, hybrid renderers, neural simulation and generated 3D scenes, with release and hardware limits.","Explore the ecosystem","docs/world-model-notes.md","3284ce6c39421d88858bdb0919306f1aa14a2c4334245530a70943f0bed9a741","cadle-repositories","Cadle-like repository research import","Cadle-like repositories","Inspect a source-reviewed ledger of Cadle-related games, browser projects, engines and agent harnesses, including unresolved candidates.","docs/cadle-repositories.md","8b51b2695a82da4a37bc0a69e39d8fdb5b6637476e15e9dd99f4500b2ad6a0e3","game-ai-notes","2D / 3D Game Development AI: Research Notes","2D & 3D development","Review AI contributions across 2D and 3D development, including executable interfaces, version limits and evaluation claims.","docs/game-ai-notes.md","ffcb9a080adca25301db04bba859b2faf2336ee85cc8d383d2bd81126f9d9b2d","engines-notes","Engines, rendering libraries, and content tools: sources and scope","Game engines","Compare game engines, rendering libraries and content tools by runtime role, source status and integration needs.","docs/engines-notes.md","f9ccc0288b0c600d0bdd576528966abf34d5dd1226cb4c6e0019a194567d9c5d","agents-notes","Coding agents and game tool integrations: source review notes","Agents, skills & MCP","Separate coding models, agent clients, skills and engine interfaces before choosing a game-development workflow.","docs/agents-notes.md","2a3353046adee5f276218ea2f22070fdd52b6e4dbe2edbd9b5a8d504418888a3","publishing-platforms","Find games and publish your own","Publishing platforms","Compare official game-store entry points and distinguish browser play, downloads, source access and release status.","Start building","docs/publishing-platforms.md","99fbc08fe205de867d62dc33da103037fb65eb6d41fa826d6eeff7f52080ae90","game-testing-library","Game testing library","Testing library","Choose runnable games, agent environments and asset sets for a concrete test, with setup and license boundaries.","docs/game-testing-library.md","0e378386fb48559079eb02b1686f10a6423e7d066d07a7b557d9d1f3522d8413","coding-agent-game-code","Coding agents × game development: code resources and game sources","Coding agents & game code","Find coding-agent skills, engine bridges and implementation examples, with client, model and game-source attribution.","docs/coding-agent-game-code.md","05671631879b7d0130a549fc1d48e4d907d56c499fb0000d32bde29a06e447bf","tutorials-and-demos","AI game builds","Tutorials & demos","Play creator-documented AI game projects and inspect their complete source, setup steps and development evidence.","docs/tutorials-and-demos.md","d4eca09cda55ddcea11d77ccf47d2f6a57087f31307e2181cb2ba4f8a8e98f3d","practical-guide","From Resource Map to Runnable Game","Practical guide","Build a complete 2D game loop in one HTML file, test win and retry, then plan your next AI-assisted change.","docs/practical-guide.md","b8358695feffa2b0a2a357f55a2f93df3d5afdeea766efb3bd848beb4c2255c8","key","document:level-design-skill","kind","id","url","/docs/level-design-skill/","collectionUrl","/docs/","blocks",[482,483,484],"docs/",{"_485":83,"_496":222,"_490":83,"_491":-7},{"_485":495,"_496":228,"_490":86,"_491":-7},{"_485":486,"_85":487,"_488":489,"_490":90,"_491":-7},"type","links","Markd